e release."},"383":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#query-the-affected-service","content":"Review its /health endpoint and its logs in the same time window. Then follow the indicated dependency: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, the OIDC provider or the cryptographic engine."},"384":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#validate-the-result-from-outside","content":"For PKI, check the certificate, the chain, OCSP or CRL with the same type of client production uses."},"385":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Replace the placeholders with your real release, namespace and deployment."},"386":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"Also run the chart's connectivity test:"},"387":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The test checks the health of CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager and VA, and verifies that the UI returns HTML. A passing test confirms basic connectivity, not a full issuance flow."},"388":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#minimal-evidence-collection","content":"The chart's services expose startup, readiness and liveness probes over /health. A pod can be running but receive no traffic if the readiness probe fails."},"389":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If you receive a 401:"},"390":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the UI's OIDC authority is reachable from the browser;"},"391":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"verify issuer, audience and expiration of the token;"},"392":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm the Gateway can fetch the keys from the JWKS URI;"},"393":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"check that the provider's public and internal routes point to the same realm."},"394":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"If login succeeds but the APIs return 403:"},"395":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"inspect the token's real claims;"},"396":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting#i-cannot-sign-in","content":"confirm they match an active principal;"},"397":{"id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deploymen